    "title": "Lounge - Groups & Events",
    "description": "Lounge allows you to easily create groups and events, add the key details and invite others with a simple link. Communicate with your members, create events, manage RSVPs, create shared albums and more. \r\n\r\nOur functionality includes:\r\n\r\n- Groups and events in seconds\r\n- 'Sublounges' for different teams or subgroups\r\n- Simple communication through posts and comments\r\n- Shared photo and video albums\r\n- Collaborative Spotify playlists\r\n- Polls\r\n- A lot more coming soon",
